WEBVTT

00:00:00.214 --> 00:00:06.338
Student accounts

00:00:06.388 --> 00:00:09.328
Open Management, then Students.

00:00:16.488 --> 00:00:18.388
Press Add Student.

00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:32.160
Choose the class and enter the student name and the parent details. The roll number is suggested for you.

00:00:43.514 --> 00:00:49.817
At the bottom, tick Create User Account. The username is suggested from the name.

00:00:56.238 --> 00:01:02.246
Enter a password of at least eight characters and confirm it. The email is optional.

00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:12.532
Press Add Student. The student and the login are created together, and the student can sign in to the Student Portal.

00:01:14.305 --> 00:01:19.245
Login created
